   "en": "A boring guy who loves erotic games dies one day from, he died from doing too much masturbate. He realized he was reincarnated in the world of the eroge \"Too Popular VR Harem at a Young Lady's School!\" as \"Sansuke Kanji,\" an old man who plays the role of a stripper pole, who sleeps with the heroines!!\n\nAnd this man is destined to die if he cheats on the heroines. He was a helpless fucking character!! The only way to change this fate is to collect a cheat item called the magic ring that can make your wish come true! Kanji tried to collect them as soon as possible, but the heroines (sluts) in the erotic game world had them...!? And for some reason, doing something erotic was the worst possible situation where he reverted back to being an old man who played the pole! (MTL)",
